apsta (0.6.2-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix maintainer scripts: debhelper snippets now run (were after exit 0)
  * Service and sleep hook resolve apsta via PATH (works for /usr/bin installs)
  * Store hotspot passwords in root-only /etc/apsta/secrets.json; migrate
    plaintext passwords out of the world-readable config.json on upgrade
  * Harden hostapd-mode runtime files (0600 configs, verified pid kills)
  * Keep virtual AP interface names within the 15-char kernel limit
  * Detect capabilities per radio instead of across all adapters
  * Recommend iptables for hostapd-mode NAT
  * Add Arch Linux PKGBUILD, pacman repo, and AUR/PPA publish automation
  * Fix CI: checkout step referenced the wrong action

 -- Karan Kumar Sah <krotrn.ks@gmail.com>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:46:52 +0000

